om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1535100/ss_10a558eecc13a10996327da3efd21734c2911995.600x338.jpg?t=1758301612"}],"short_description":"Nadir is a roguelike deck-builder with a twist: the cost to play a card is an enemy reaction you can predict. Craft your own cards to slay powerful demons. Gather resources, expand your city, grow in power and conquer the underworld.","steam_appid":1535100,"support_info":{"email":"press@nadirthegame.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Russian, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Ukrainian","type":"game","website":null}